       </table></ix:continuation></div><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;text-decoration:underline solid;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Financial Instruments Recorded Using Fair Value Option</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The Company has elected the fair value option for loans held for sale.  These loans are intended for sale and the Company believes that the fair value is the best indicator of the resolution of these loans. Interest income is recorded based on the contractual terms of the loan and in accordance with the Company&#8217;s policy on loans held for investment.  </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_4f69bd73-51ac-4fd9-9b10-871ace1c97c1" contextRef="C_f45d7a11-bc75-4784-bc28-4abc4106d8ed" name="us-gaap:FairValueOptionLoansHeldAsAssets90DaysOrMorePastDue" unitRef="U_USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen"><ix:nonFraction id="F_4caea0d3-df80-477c-b206-8568fe378cf1" contextRef="C_646ed683-2d6c-4bb5-919d-d3b36a476ad7" name="us-gaap:FairValueOptionLoansHeldAsAssets90DaysOrMorePastDue" unitRef="U_USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">No</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">ne of these loans were 90 days or more past due or on nonaccrual as of </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">June 30, 2026 or December 31, 2025.</span></p><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_d67bf9a2-8609-4e37-90b0-fa77077e4308" contextRef="C_8580465d-1880-4447-ac41-2203ef31166b" name="us-gaap:FairValueOptionQuantitativeDisclosuresTextBlock" escape="true"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">As of </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025, the aggregate fair value, contractual balance and gain or loss on loans held for sale were as follows:</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p>
