ont-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">trading plan for estate and financial planning purposes.  The plan is intended to satisfy the affirmative defense under Rule 10b5-1(c) of the Exchange Act.  Mr. O'Dell currently holds </span></div></div></ix:nonNumeric></div></div>
